# being
- #reality means is to be fit for being #definition
- #essence -> #soul , #substance doing by nature potentially #knowing; #soul is #potentially #knower
- #substance act exist through it, in it
- #knowing is the #intellect & #universal #definition
- #intellect is completeness and clarity of its existence 
- its unknownness is other than #essence #definition
- knowledge: appearantness of #things in the #self, #knower makes things appear in the self, #unknown = unappearant in self
- known = day, #unknown = night

